      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Good race with a few of these having raced each other lately. REGAL ZEUS (1) has found his form after looking a bit in the wilderness, leading all the way to win the Listed Testa Rossa decisively two back at Caulfield, beating RUN HARRY RUN (2) by 1.5 lengths. REGAL ZEUS has since run well in the Listed Weekend Hussler and should be very hard to catch around here. RUN HARRY RUN will be right there on straightening and can get over the top late. BOSSY BENITA (4) was good second up behind Point Barrow and up to 1400m looks ideal, she should be ready to peak now. MOBY DICK (6) best of the rest but the trip is a query.",
